OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm project expected to be
OL,4,Aprogressed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #18.6m solar farm that a council
OL,7,Fwants to build on some of its
OL,8,Fagricultural land should continue,
OL,9,Fcouncillors will be told next week.
OL,11,FWest Berkshire Council's Grazeley Solar
OL,12,FFarm could produce enough electricity
OL,13,Fto power at least 5,500 homes, the
OL,14,Fauthority said.
OL,16,FPlanning permission has already been
OL,17,Fgranted for the council-owned site at
OL,18,FBloomfield Hatch Farm, between Mortimer
OL,19,Fand Grazeley, and it expects to make a
OL,20,Fprofit of about #400,000 annually over
OL,21,F30 years.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
