OL,4,Aprogressed
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior councillors will be asked to
OL,7,Fprogress the project at a meeting on
OL,8,FThursday, which would allow officers to
OL,9,Forganise procurement and connections to
OL,10,Fthe grid.
